{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/manchester-city-residence-ohana-development-yas-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1395,"crm_id":"7483","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Manchester City Residence","slug":"manchester-city-residence-ohana-development-yas-island","display_address":"Yas Island","building_type":["apartment","penthouse","villa","mansions"],"completion_year":"2028","developer":"Ohana Development","price":1700000,"display_price":"1.7M","lattitude":24.477809896152,"longitude":54.609823250051,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Manchester City Yas Residences is a canal-facing luxury community located on <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/yas-island/\">Yas Island</a>, Abu Dhabi’s most iconic lifestyle and sports destination. These branded residences are developed by Ohana Development in partnership with the globally recognized football club, Manchester City. &nbsp;</p><p>The project features <strong>1 to 5-bedroom apartments, penthouses, villas, and mansions</strong>. Designed around space, privacy, and waterfront living, the units are available with a highly flexible payment plan, making it the lowest entry point project of this stature.</p><p>Manchester City Residences Yas Island emphasizes modern minimalist architecture, expansive green corridors, and waterfront living. Residents benefit from parks, landscaped walkways, and jogging and cycling paths, while the strong global branding and Yas Island’s growth trajectory support long-term capital appreciation potential.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/ohana_feature_0dbe2a4bc0.jpg","hash":"ohana_feature_0dbe2a4bc0","name":"ohana-feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.